<title>USA: Executone Q1 net per share profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Executone Q1 net per share profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MILFORD, Conn. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.01     loss	 $0.10</p>
<p> Net profit		   512     loss	 5,358</p>
<p> Revs			39,019		   66,966</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  50,229		   51,853</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Executone Information Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 results include revenue from telephony direct sales and service business, which was sold in May 1996. That 1996 quarter also includes pre-tax $4.9 million reserve for the shutdown and sale of the videoconferencing and inmate calling businesses.</p>
